  assert.match(PLACES.lava_falls.found, /hold a Meat Ration, to get close/);
  // The entities: the act (0 to 9) and the glide synced; no gravity, no walking, never pushed; 2.4 by 2.2, a hatchling
  // 0.9 by 0.8; fire-proof; no attack of any kind; three coats; the wild one despawns, the zoo one stays.
